      <activity id="08f14b4c-d6aa-5f32-9037-b287dc4cc5af" activityNameId="dc0f647c-7c24-5635-8239-b655edab04ea" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Non-Fe-metals, hydrometallurgical processing Li-ion batteries, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Non-Fe-metals, hydrometallurgical processing Li-ion batteries, at plant
The multioutput-process " hydrometallurgical treatment Li-ion batteries " delivers the co-products "disposal, Li-ion batteries, hydrometallurgical” ,”Co powder, hydrometallurgical processing Li-ion batteries, at plant”, “Li salt, hydrometallurgical processing Li-ion batteries, at plant”, “iron and steel, hydrometallurgical processing Li-ion batteries, at plant” and " non-Fe-metals, hydrometallurgical processing Li-ion batteries, at plant". The allocation is done 100% to the disposal process.;
UUID: 25c94237-c4fc-4912-8c81-fd9ffaf9434d
This dataset represents the treatment of Li-Ion batteries from electric and electronic devices by a hydrometallurgical process. It includes energy &amp; auxiliary consumption, waste production, emission (to air/to water) production and rough estimations of the efforts for infrastructure &amp; transportation.
Location: Data from a European recycling company - used as global average data.
Technology: Shredder, followed by a chemical treatment in order to separate the various fractions produced
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Company information &amp; own estimation 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_25c94237-c4fc-4912-8c81-fd9ffaf9434d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
